/v1/","context":{"app_id":4214860,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4214860","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:16Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4952010","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1846651706691097","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"rock is part of Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Happy to announce rock\\ is part of the Steam Next Fest!Over the last 4 months, the rock\\ demo has been tweaked, refined, and perfected! It's now a condensed hour-long game which rivals most released incremental games!Please go and check out it out, new or returning, and I'll guarantee you'll discover something new!And, please leave a review on the demo page, so more people can see it. As a solo dev, this 2 minute activity helps massively in getting more exposure + giving me valuable feedback abo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:30:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691097","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1846018067940038","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.5 - Polish + Steam Next Fest!","summary":"hey guys!The Steam Next Fest is almost upon us, so I've been polishing, balancing, and tweaking Dyrt to make it as fun as possible! I've also been working hard on the other two planets...v0.6.5balancingmade you start with the orange hitbar unlockedchanged stall upgrade ordermade all minerals less volatilemade ayi appear every 3 days instead of 4minor balancing everywheremade it so duplicate items can't appear in the stallincreased red power cost scalingincreased base orange, green, and blue powe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:20:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940038","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1844751498230809","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"update","title":"kruos update + bugfixes","summary":"hey all, realised I forgot to update you guys on the Kruos changes. gonna do another patch later in the week for some balancing and bugfixing but i think it's pretty much done and ready for releasedyrtfixed bleeg overlapping with item descriptionfixed item selection tutorial softlockadded mission progress indicatorkruoscontent removed autoclick powerup removed pause powerupremoved double minerals powerup changed more rocks powerup to spawn more rocks immediately added 4 new powerups qol increase","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T07:56:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230809","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1843481262693865","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"update","title":"kruos update - new powerups + currency","summary":"Thanks to all who have played and left feedback :)So far, it seems like you all prefer the first planet which makes sense as it's a more balanced and polished experience. I'm hoping this update evens things out a little bit.patch notesadded click boost tutorial for egg added 2 new powerupsadded a setting to lock clicky in place added a new currency for the tavernadded new drink modifier for the new currency added new default portion to wheelremoved insta break powerup removed double click poweru","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T02:06:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693865","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1842846814445131","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.3 - cool stuff + new planet on beta!","summary":"Hi all!We've had lots of new demo players recently from this video. Certainly an interesting watch...v0.6.3added some effects to the shipfixed input keys not being legibleyou can now no longer bind certain keysadded autoclicker setting - people were using autoclickers so might as well put it in the game. as i mentioned in the tooltip, using an autoclicker early game is fine, but late game it will slow your progress quite a bitnew planet!It's been a long time coming, but I think the next planet i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T02:35:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445131","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1840944183785272","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.2 - what's all this then?","summary":"qoladded audio to dialogue system so it's more interactiveadded \"skip dialogue\" option to settingsadded tutorial to exchangeadded tutorial to scientist after orange portion is unlockedadded helper text when you buy your first item and unlock boostbugfixing/balancingfixed more asteroids upgrade not workingmade more asteroids upgrade price scale faster made pickaxe slightly weakermade stopwatch way stronger","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T06:51:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785272","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1840944183778662","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.1 - less clicking, more fun","summary":"so...much...balancing... since I started dev on rock\\, I've struggled with the \"spam-clicking\" aspect. On one hand, I want to give players full agency of the game, including the scientist's hitbar. If that means they want to spam-click and upgrade the red portion, they are free to do so. However, after doing some super invaluable IRL playtesting a few days ago (which I'll go into more detail on in the next next devlog), it was painfully obvious that the game's biggest flaw was that players still","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T06:04:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183778662","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1840310314338892","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6a & 0.6b","summary":"fixed trackpad mode reworked dialogue system added extra dialogue to merchant and exchange minor balancing to make thruster speed scale a tad fastermade all boost related stuff a lot more expensivemade corundum appear earlier added tooltip to endless mode button fixed some dialogue system bugs fixed being able to click settings once demo is completed to cancel the transition animation fixed not opening to exclusive fullscreenfixed (?) new portion button revealing when already unlocked all four c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T11:00:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338892","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1839676055884011","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6 - stall upgrades and balancing","summary":"hello again! just wanted to say a massive thank you to all the players who have been playing the demo and giving feedback! another reminder to leave a review here if you haven't already! v0.6 - major balancing and merchant upgradescontent3 new items fortified: asteroids are stronger but drop more mineralsmad scientist: potions are more potentrefined tech: multihit does more damage but hitbar replenishes slower (will likely be adjusted)stopwatch reworked: more minerals in the last 5s the merchant","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T02:20:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055884011","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1839041357037218","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.5.5a","summary":"added scientist power level description to show damage, hit size, and mineral value for each levelrebalanced how power level impacts different statsadded chill mode and zen mode with autocollect automatically enabled and less/no clickingreworked scientist for zen mode","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T02:51:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357037218","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1839041357034990","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.5.5 - scientist rework","summary":"earth to all demo players... first of all, thank you so much to all who have been trying out the demo! we've had 75 players so far, very cool! also a reminder to leave a review - these majorly impact the game's visibility and help out a lot! positive or negative, all feedback is good feedback. now, onto some fixes... v0.5.5 scientist changed the scientist introduction to be spread across 3 days changed hitbar damage to hitbar power which effects damage, hit size, and mineral value added hitbar e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T07:17:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357034990","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4214860-1839041357033339","game_id":"steam-4214860","kind":"announcement","title":"rock 's free demo is available now!","summary":"I hate to be the one to tell you all this, but after a pummeling, your rock\\ has had no choice but to land on Dyrt...But, never fear, for Dyrt's residents are very capable, and have offered to help you escape!Each playthrough is a little different!The free demo is available now and offers:⏰: 45-60 minutes of gameplay🌏: 1 planet⚙️: 6 different upgrade systems💎: 6 different minerals♾️: endless mode🤖: NO AIDon't forget to leave a review and happy exploring! :)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T07:27:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033339","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4214860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4214860":"2026-10-26T01:49:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4214860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4952010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:07Z"